@startuml static_proxy_sequence
title Static Proxy - sekwencja

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 150

actor Client
participant ReportServiceProxy
participant RealReportService

Client -> ReportServiceProxy : GetMonthlyReport(month)
ReportServiceProxy -> ReportServiceProxy : check role + log
ReportServiceProxy -> RealReportService : GetMonthlyReport(month)
RealReportService --> ReportServiceProxy : report
ReportServiceProxy --> Client : report

@enduml
